{"id":"93bd74c69a0041c9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-constructible-consequence-norm.md","title":"构造层级中部分后果模型的序数范数","display":"df-constructible-consequence-norm — 构造层级中部分后果模型的序数范数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-constructible-consequence-norm","aliases":["72-df-constructible-consequence-norm"],"display":"df-constructible-consequence-norm — 构造层级中部分后果模型的序数范数","depends_on":["[[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.2 equations(8)–(9), print216/PDF228; partial-domain qualification","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source norm correspondence and partial-domain well-definedness checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"将范数输入的闭句集构造移入 Assertion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-constructible-consequence-norm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-constructible-consequence-norm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructible-consequence-norm — 构造层级中部分后果模型的序数范数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a817d4e9e855b803\" href=\"?note=a817d4e9e855b803\" title=\"72-df-constructible-hierarchy\">72-df-constructible-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.2 equations(8)–(9), print216/PDF228; partial-domain qualification"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source norm correspondence and partial-domain well-definedness checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"将范数输入的闭句集构造移入 Assertion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal S_\\in\\)</span> 是下式将定义的闭句集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,C\\subseteq\\mathcal S_\\in\">\\(T,C\\subseteq\\mathcal S_\\in\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 到基本公式的经典展开；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a> 的有身份等式公理演算，使用句子假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e[T]\">\\(e[T]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T)\\)</span>、范数定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_*\">\\(\\mathcal D_*\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_C(T)\">\\(\\nu_C(T)\\)</span> 在下式引入；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,C)\\in\\mathcal D_*\">\\((T,C)\\in\\mathcal D_*\\)</span> 时才取最小序数。类上的最小值表示其唯一最小见证，不将全体序数作为集合域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_\\in:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_\\in:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T):=\\{A\\in C:e[T]\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}e(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T):=\\{A\\in C:e[T]\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}e(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_*:=\\{\\langle T,C\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal S_\\in)^2:\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (L_\\alpha\\models_s\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_*:=\\{\\langle T,C\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal S_\\in)^2:\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (L_\\alpha\\models_s\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu_C(T):=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:L_\\alpha\\models_s\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T)\\}\n\\quad(\\langle T,C\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu_C(T):=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:L_\\alpha\\models_s\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T)\\}\n\\quad(\\langle T,C\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>C 指定所检查的句子复杂度类，得到原书部分模型范数；C 取全部句子则对应完整后果模型。不能对任意不一致 T 无条件定义这个最小值。只要类中有一个序数见证 α，在 α+1 内取满足条件的非空子集即可找到最小值，故在显示定义域上唯一确定。此处未证明任意给定 T 的范数存在、可数或等于本册另行定义的 Π¹₁ 可证良序序数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-constructible-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"a817d4e9e855b803","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal S_\\in$ 是下式将定义的闭句集；$T,C\\subseteq\\mathcal S_\\in$。$e$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 到基本公式的经典展开；$\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}$ 为 [[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]] 的有身份等式公理演算，使用句子假设 $e[T]$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal S_\\in$ 是下式将定义的闭句集；$T,C\\subseteq\\mathcal S_\\in$。$e$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 到基本公式的经典展开；$\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}$ 为 [[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]] 的有身份等式公理演算，使用句子假设 $e[T]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"T,C\\subseteq\\mathcal S_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}","display":false},{"tex":"e[T]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_*","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_C(T)","display":false},{"tex":"(T,C)\\in\\mathcal D_*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_\\in:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T):=\\{A\\in C:e[T]\\vdash_{\\Sigma_\\in}^{=}e(A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_*:=\\{\\langle T,C\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal S_\\in)^2:\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\ (L_\\alpha\\models_s\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu_C(T):=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:L_\\alpha\\models_s\\operatorname{Cons}_C(T)\\}\n\\quad(\\langle T,C\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_*).","display":true}],"bytes":2452,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-496","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-491","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-d